## Mode A baseline notes

In the bench harness, "Mode A" is set via `JXL_W44_166_VARIANT_Z_ADMIT_MODE=A`
to disable the admission for comparison. In production (env unset),
the default is Mode B (= shipped). The example harness explicitly
sets the env var on every encode for self-documentation; in
production callers do nothing and get Mode B.

